      "still": "Checking. Unglazed and matte, eyes closed. The evidence is not current, so she claims nothing yet. In the world: body upright at 95% scale, eyes closed, brow soft, mouth level, surface matte, unglazed, offline. Unglazed: this device is offline. Half full; $4000.00 in The Fund. Crown lit: both of you are here. 1 gold seam: a correction mended and left visible. The vine is Make Rent Boring, week 2, grown by 1 act. 3 buds: Fictional seasonal reserve, A slower week away, Fictional trip to the shore. 1 dated obligation at her feet; the nearest is within two weeks. At her hands, one Move: Choose which payday the pre-rent check belongs to."
